player_prompt.intro:
Droe neuh Player {player_id} lam dilema tahanan 3 ureueng. Patandingan nyan truk {num_rounds} ronde.
Struktur ronde:
• {conv_rounds} giliran chat bebas
• 1 giliran keputusan - kirim saboh token per lawan: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' atawa '[<opp-id> defect]' (mis. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; lalok 'cooperate'). 
Matriks bayaran pasangan (diterapkan ke pasangan tak teratur):
  - Duwa-duwe cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Duwa-duwe defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Droe defect, gata cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Droe cooperate, gata defect -> {sucker}
Ureueng nyang na leubeh poin di akhir ronde nyan meunang.
